{"articleNo":"63458","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=63458&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"사회봉사 과목 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.09.03","hit":"7861","attachments":[{"name":"사회봉사활동 확인서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=63458&attachNo=2316"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">사회봉사1,2 과목 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;사회봉사 과목에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이 안내 하오니, 수강 학생은 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 수강 신청&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">사회봉사1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 아래 사항 중 어느 하나에 해당하는 경우 수강 신청 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① 사회봉사 과목을 처음 수강 신청하는 학생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">이전에 ‘사회봉사1’ 과목을 수강 신청은 하였으나 사회봉사 활동확인서를</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;제출하지 않아 미이수(U)한 학생의 경우 신청 가능.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">사회봉사2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : ‘사회봉사1’ 과목을 이수(S)한 학생만 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 한 학기 동시 수강(사회봉사1, 사회봉사2)&nbsp;불가</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 117.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -117.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 사회봉사인정기간(차후 기간변경 없음) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 117.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -117.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;1학기 : 전년도</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> 12월 1일 ~ 금년도&nbsp; 5월 31일까지 수행한 봉사활동(방학포함)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;2학기 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">금년도&nbsp; 6월 1일 ~ 금년도 11월 30일까지 수행한 봉사활동(방학포함)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3.&nbsp; 제출서류 : 사회봉사 활동확인서 원본</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 73.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -73.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(본교 사회봉사활동확인서 양식 및 사회봉사활동 기관에서 발급한 사회봉사활동확인서 등 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 73.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -73.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 사회봉사기관명, 사회봉사 활동 총시간이 확인 가능한 원본 서류이면 가능함) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 73.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -73.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 73.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -73.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 제출기간 : 별도공지(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1학기 : 6월 초(예정), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2학기 :12월 초(예정))<br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 사회봉사 학점 인정 이수시간 : 30시간 이상 이수 시 1학점 인정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">6. 사회봉사활동의 범위와 대상</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 국가, 지방자치단체, 공공기관 등에서 실시한 봉사활동</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 34pt; TEXT-INDENT: -34pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 국</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">가, 지방자치단체, 공공기관에 등록된 사회복지기관 및 시설에서 실시한 봉사활동</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 농어촌 봉사, 환경정화, 자연보호, 의료봉사 활동</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 기타 학부장이 인정하는 봉사활동</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 헌혈(사회봉사1, 사회봉사2 각각 1회에 한하여 4시간 인정)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">7. 기타사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 11pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">사회</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">봉사활동 확인서(양식)이 필요한 학생은 우리학교 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">홈페이지 - 교육·학사 - 자료실에서 다운로드</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">하여</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 사용 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">교 무 처 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
